(c) whether this dependence has adversely affected the objectives of the Advanced Chemistry Cell (ACC)-Production Linked Incentive (PLI) scheme; and
(d) the steps being taken to develop domestic processing, refining and manufacturing capacity for battery raw materials and to reduce reliance on imports?
