(c) whether Government has considered Tamil Nadu's request to enhance Union assistance under PMMSY in view of the increasing financial burden on States, if so, the details thereof?

(a) the existing SOPs and safety policies in place for air travel and helicopter operations, whether any gaps have been identified in the existing safety regime and the steps that have been taken post the recent mishap to strengthen these protocols;
(b) the current status of expansion works at Chennai, Madurai, Coimbatore, Tiruchirappalli, Thoothukudi, and Salem airports, including budget allocations, project scope, expected completion timelines; and
(c) the reasons for exclusion of Madurai Airport-despite its significant tourism and economic potential—from the list of designated Points-of-Call under the ASEAN–India Air Transport Agreement, and the steps taken to include Madurai?

