(b) the current status of Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited’s (BSNL) integration with the PM-WANI framework, including the number of Wi-Fi hotspots already migrated or proposed to be migrated under the scheme; and
(c) whether Government has a long-term vision or plan in place to revive BSNL, and the present status of its 5G rollout across the country?

